  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08981739c2141836ff82ae17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "三姐妹依偎在一起的和声，温柔地抚慰着心灵——\\n让歌声与思念重叠吧。即便道路不同，我们永远相伴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9f7c4320d72326928aeb745d027513123f087fcbebe37d79ffeff29b23d3d84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5211f4e063be40a6a9173da2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "寄宿着觉悟的少女们，坚定不移的决心之曲。\\n因为宿敌赋予了我们力量——无论到哪里，都一起前行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbb53245b325ebfca1516edec8af4086451cfb887970e6ac7601443e18e2185f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1192"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06e4e59b2d3f9bfe2d6b3676",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "深入畅谈，真诚以待。一同烦恼，并肩追逐同一个梦想。\\n将珍藏着满满回忆的相册铭记于心——去超越至今为止的一切吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c5dd7cfe07629e8b9f0777b6ff60f60a76ca6c15ad16b039a34f84d4bfccd41",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1193"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aafe15d2df6fdfd97742c4a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "做好觉悟吧。只要听过一次，\\n就会烙印在耳膜与灵魂深处，挥之不去的黄金旋律。",
      "source_fingerprint": "620f5fa19ff1345168acb8061fb065806157800c0edd889f0198b2ed8abd816f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1194"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2711c46d5d0acbbfefd6e67d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起舞、许愿、高歌、祈祷，直至心意传抵苍穹。\\n在舞台上响彻回荡的汝之名，定将为这片大地带来光明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed42af5122f578a316d7f565658610c2e946d329f462a6fc3c33d91e5fd638da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1195"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dc41793eb087de97f115375",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，今晚也要互诉心声吗？我们要传达的可是彼此的爱。\\n打开社区的大门——就是Love me♡Love you♡哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "4eb6834dc87892265787d83a03e5093e067978927759489246e65b0dacb554f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1200"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51ab7d697ef6ed2a84a96f6b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "所需要的，是一点点勇气。即使害怕，只要描绘出来就一定会改变。\\n因为不想只停留在想象中——就迈出脚步吧，趁现在！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ba97c4f5a9e7a4211f229648fa6054a5b58ff5e4d968c9765d561ff152ab3b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00caaf81ef1bfdc530de2be7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呜呼哦哦哦！尊爆赛马娘酱的坑来啦━(ﾟ∀ﾟ)━！！\\n感谢与推相遇的奇迹！祈求全推幸福世界最尊！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4174052e79016932d7dd7b0f63ac278b2904480a2322a4894775e102ddb2ba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1202"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdbe180fe7755e28db53c660",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请，轻轻地牵起彼此的手。因为那份温暖，会化作\\n思念的圆环——为了能传达到所有孤独之人的心中，倾注祈愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6a4f61df378b5f4621ca2073fe7e36dcd375b5b99f736ad896590df45b3fb22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d2fcc97a3c212eb39816e0a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "跑完英里达成我的哩规则！满面笑容这就登场！\\n比任何人都想要闪耀的这个舞台，唯独第一绝不让步！Go Go 英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a8bf8f99b4424ae00137fc3f8962c1c2017dce9aa53c73aeba34fbb542b461f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc08dd262784c96efb2d49f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "伴随着直指顶点的热情节拍，狂热度达到最高潮！\\n来吧，去超越极限，为了在全新的舞台上闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ff127602f78156f3dbde7f7f36ae691730f811706be800bc488c0564a1eb9cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21f605c63854c903cd62da6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呐，愿意带我走吗？前往我所未知的崭新世界！\\n若这只是泡沫般的片刻——那就如做梦一般，踏上旅途吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d632644e126ffd28fe3e652bd793bf2e39fc1eacbbbe45225b0fc13e5b23ae01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f307f697da4527aeb4ed2e2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "气氛嗨到爆！情绪拉到满！趴体・Party・fu～♪\\n果然还是辣妹YYDS对吧♪毕竟今天的主角可是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f93468050cbe0a90a6bc6cade0be164a9390fdab7481f3c5eec67b137a92474",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e5c0ffaae0244dfe287bf58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在怀旧的旋律中，回想起的是黄金般的心象。\\n自由的旅人未曾停下脚步——无论谁，都会对那段旅途心怀梦想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "faca9261ad3069a4d790ff629f2d61360662f3d1ad256b8c73250134dca73570",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8b1bda58646dbca4f82be52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要想夺取顶点就绝不妥协。顺从本能，将其粉碎吧！\\n咆哮吧——刻印在新时代之上，那才是最强的证明！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf1934605b6aee88cd9af2df4c3b44828d688d3310f1eea48072858f27e329cd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:407aec1b218e99a19d7916a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正因为有劲敌们在，新时代才得以开辟。\\n如果有想要抵达的地方——那就一起奔跑吧，前往终幕的彼方",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c51041d9dec2064f5fec1eef8e151e8f6585240c80b791ec023190fdfe2577d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e13f98dfb63f95532715432",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "伴着律动感十足的旋律，对美味的期待雀跃难抑！\\n让人忍不住想要吮指的这顿佳肴，狠狠地大口咬下试试看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecdd9760f4e17401fbd5506619d1f2ed0cd126160ff0254cb8382a30b0e82a72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d52f3f4c61b8c9e208dbd1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "开心到玩得太嗨、笑到疯狂生草www的赛马娘们的\\n轻松欢快单曲。只要听了，连笑容都会跟着破土萌发！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c7e7efd69f63d17ad826a43abd95c9e172155d25038a5cb198e27c763d62322",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "1212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18c01e630106062933a24c66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "突然开播的新闻节目「スタホTV」的BGM。\\n听到这首歌的话，就关注一下StarHorse4的最新情报吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff88f1c8d4bc85f005c4e63ef50a47ef3e37c4a8b6e6fcd2a150345dd4aa3579",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8501"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb0b462dec6ce7483d1984c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说到StarHorse的条件战就想到融合音乐。\\n能感受到系列正统进化的歌曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92e9c32024270140aff8895e2b03c1e9bf097039ad5675d6f969594d0544d6c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8502"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d5451e20e0ad9ba8c9eab1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出道时若播放这首歌将备受瞩目！\\n在StarHorse4中听见这首歌是玩家的目标之一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab4aa25cbb30474e38d07f5289e1111931509561165e6397ff7a91783ba98f37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3ef29ce6fdf321ce57e473",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于StarHorse4的生产环节播放的BGM。\\n是能够慢慢思考自己专属血统表的曲风。",
      "source_fingerprint": "804813b23274f0fa5464d3699b9159a183052c8de67dd6a6580f7ec0c89094ae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8504"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:841806db2b66318ec21ab8ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于StarHorse4的生产环节播放的BGM。\\n随着成长过程与影片一同欣赏十分令人心满意足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c06fe6197c37523036962e78d55dbdc087937b5b39d0ced60f322e9cc515b3f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8505"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f3111e6b58d38db3678e5dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ春の１曲。\\nそのハーモニーは新たな生命の息吹を感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffc003000aad4224b69f71a58420ec0a6b3a06fdbd3457e7fdde3bdc54c4d9e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8506"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a20b550318ee5cde16fe76d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ夏の１曲。\\nそのリズムは降り注ぐ太陽の煌きを感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac8325932e171f1c380e956e9db5eab38d4f7e647e5822ac67d0bebbdc0a47e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8507"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c684e9076ead3727b6a3faf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ秋の１曲。\\n切ないラインは美しい紅葉の騒めきを感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b3d72961f3fde3fafe83fda23f14c4d63384013f90231f4d87f8a5f73d8967a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8508"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae0b5e7b0ff57c90f0490b59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズ冬の１曲。\\n繊細な旋律は白銀に染まる冬暁を感じさせる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5daa0b17d296e0404b824efa6c464688de030df1d78ee8cf645fd99cb040cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
        "8509"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50880d9e7494a9e76faf7c62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ダービースタリオン マスターズの超決戦で流れるＢＧＭ。\\n決意と共に白熱する激闘の熱気を感じさせる１曲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb1c122dfb6ded7cd31470b7137297c19a15506808366ec69074539ab7a3aea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "128",
